e bracket and knob for easy adjustment, easy to install and hang on the floor, truss and ceiling. Good for long time working\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"b863584d-aaca-4456-8af0-9b01fea3859f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"LED Panel\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 459, \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"kappg\\\\\\"><b>ROSS CHASING LED BAR 320</b></p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"h6ypq\\\\\\">RGB 320 pcs (128 red, 96 green, 96 blue)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"btbf2\\\\\\">Control: DMX512,</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"6s14o\\\\\\">sound activated,</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2c220\\\\\\">firmware Effects: strobe, dimmer, running lights</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"25 Gel/ps\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Illuminate your event with brilliance! Our LED spotlights for rent will transform any stage, adding vibrant colors and dynamic lighting effects to create an unforgettable atmosphere\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"f9777c9f-fa21-4f81-980b-352eb461808b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"Rotating led Heads\\", \\"pfoto_equipment\\": 461, \\"description_equipment\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"umi6n\\\\\\">Motorized LED Mini Spotlight</p>\\", \\"characteristic_equipment\\": \\"<ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"a3uk1\\\\\\">Motorized LED Mini Spotlight (Rotating Head)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8mg8d\\\\\\">7 LEDs (8W each)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5nqvc\\\\\\">4-in-1 (red, green, blue, white)</li></ul>\\", \\"price_equipment\\": \\"25 Gel/ps\\", \\"promou_equipment\\": \\"Elevate the romance on your special day with our exquisite LED spotlights for weddings. Create a magical ambiance, highlight key moments, and turn your wedding into a visually stunning celebration that will be remembered forever\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"fae7635e-ff44-4740-9bc5-a2ce73e0ca7f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"eqipment_cards\\", \\"value\\": {\\"name_equipment\\": \\"